│ Conclusion The results of this study will be useful in the rationale selection of anti-epileptic drugs with the      │
│ objective of minimizing, as much as possible, their cognitive side effects.ajol.info"}, {"study_index": 23, "title": │
│ "The efficacy of carbamazepine combinations in epilepsy", "abstract": "The efficacy and bioavailability, and         │
